   302	   works for one tester and does not scale. If the author names no channel, every relying party except a
   303	   hand-delivered one relies on an assumption, and G1–G10 then hold only conditionally (contract §2, "the checker's
   304	   verifier release is authentic"). Only the author can supply this channel. It is due before the first public
   305	   release, not the freeze, but the relying-party text frozen on 30 Oct must already say which case applies.
