    36	   model abstracts "signature checks … as passing" (`tla/P5P6_TemporalRevocation.tla:54-56`). So no model shows that
    37	   one receipt meets C1–C3 and C5 at once. The only joins are L-05 and L-19, both prose (table above).
    38	2. **"The signatures existed by T" is not modelled.** The signature-inclusive anchor (`A_sig`) is an assumption
    39	   on both sides (`docs/V1-CONTRACT.md:90`).
    40	3. **Terms are not bytes.** In ProVerif "the same bytes" means "the same term" (`suite/s-p1/READING-AIDS.md:257-259`).
    41	   The byte link is P8: a prose proof plus vectors, not machine-checked (`docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-9.md:203-204`).
