   410	
   411	For this bounded, single-clock, pre-latch issuance model, a shipped attempt has an in-window, sufficiently buried anchor that permitted reorgs cannot orphan, an expired unshipped attempt cannot ship, and final expiry without shipping atomically enters a refusal that persists and excludes shipping. (`P5c_IssuanceProtocol.tla:199–207`, `P5c_IssuanceProtocol.tla:236–277`, `P5c_IssuanceProtocol.tla:292–337`, `P5c_IssuanceProtocol.tla:118–126`.)
